{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432490/extras/ea62d4a35c3d1adcb582c5abedf4b0d3.avif?t=1760538318\" width=600 height=240 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A first-person horror game where you play as a desperate man seeking a cure for his sick wife in a mysterious vineyard. Harvest, crush and ferment grapes as you uncover the secret beyond the basement doors.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u>STORY</u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your wife is sick, the doctors say there is no cure. After hearing about a vineyard that has supernatural murmurings, you believe this to be your only chance of saving her. As you go about making bottles of wine to feed the vineyard, you ask yourself, what does this place desire and what can it offer you in return?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432490/extras/9101cdef8cd69b268d01b508ef73f35f.poster.avif?t=1760538318\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432490/extras/9101cdef8cd69b268d01b508ef73f35f.webm?t=1760538318\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432490/extras/9101cdef8cd69b268d01b508ef73f35f.mp4?t=1760538318\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u>FEATURES</u></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Winemaking</strong> - Go through the process of harvesting, crushing, fermenting and pouring to create wine.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Conceptual Horror</strong> - A horror game based on atmosphere, dread and a slow build.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Compact Experience</strong> - With a playtime of 40-60 minutes, this is a horror game designed to be played in one sitting.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Retro-Inspired Aesthetic</strong> - A toggleable, claustrophobic 4:3 aspect ratio and PSX style graphics help create a retro feel.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Solo Dev</strong> - A game created solely by me, allowing an unfettered vison.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3432490?t=1760538318","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3432490?t=1760538318","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432490/419019f0f1c86bfae4cab95cf4d6ac2cb9308005/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760538318","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432490/419019f0f1c86bfae4cab95cf4d6ac2cb9308005/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760538318","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"Unsettling horror themes."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432490/extras/ea62d4a35c3d1adcb582c5abedf4b0d3.avif?t=1760538318\" width=600 height=240 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A first-person horror game where you play as a desperate man seeking a cure for his sick wife in a mysterious vineyard. Harvest, crush and ferment grapes as you uncover the secret beyond the basement doors.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u>STORY</u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your wife is sick, the doctors say there is no cure. After hearing about a vineyard that has supernatural murmurings, you believe this to be your only chance of saving her. As you go about making bottles of wine to feed the vineyard, you ask yourself, what does this place desire and what can it offer you in return?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432490/extras/9101cdef8cd69b268d01b508ef73f35f.poster.avif?t=1760538318\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432490/extras/9101cdef8cd69b268d01b508ef73f35f.webm?t=1760538318\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432490/extras/9101cdef8cd69b268d01b508ef73f35f.mp4?t=1760538318\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u>FEATURES</u></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Winemaking</strong> - Go through the process of harvesting, crushing, fermenting and pouring to create wine.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Conceptual Horror</strong> - A horror game based on atmosphere, dread and a slow build.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Compact Experience</strong> - With a playtime of 40-60 minutes, this is a horror game designed to be played in one sitting.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Retro-Inspired Aesthetic</strong> - A toggleable, claustrophobic 4:3 aspect ratio and PSX style graphics help create a retro feel.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Solo Dev</strong> - A game created solely by me, allowing an unfettered vison.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Sitting Elephant"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432490/a0d16ba6fdb230788bbaa7c2a9ce3c61e397981f/header.jpg?t=1760538318","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3432490/1016622491/b800cb32f9af056f0207233b063c5e1aa16e8c65/1756130577/dash_av1.mpd?t=1756806548","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3432490/1016622491/b800cb32f9af056f0207233b063c5e1aa16e8c65/1756130577/dash_h264.mpd?t=1756806548","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3432490/1016622491/b800cb32f9af056f0207233b063c5e1aa16e8c65/1756130577/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1756806548","id":257188489,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257188489/movie480.mp4?t=1756806548","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257188489/movie_max.mp4?t=1756806548"},"name":"GameplayTrailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257188489/a7b6a6d478f31cf719c36e8ce0771ac7f4ac067c/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1756806548","webm":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257188489/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1756806548","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257188489/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1756806548"}}],"name":"Vineyard","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Quad-core Intel or AMD, 2.5 GHz or faster<br></li><l